{"id":"en_flash-marriage-to-my-billionaire-hobo-hubby","title":"Flash Marriage To My Billionaire Hobo Hubby","titleEn":"Flash Marriage To My Billionaire Hobo Hubby","description":"Katie works as an andrologist, and her mother gives her a deadline of one month to get married so the family business stays secure. Nate, who runs Blake Group as CEO, ends up in a humiliating andrology exam meant to confirm he is \"functional.\" When the two cross paths at the hospital, it leads them into a contract marriage. Neither realizes the other's real position: Katie is the hidden Reed heiress, while Nate is living undercover as an ordinary employee. As genuine feelings start to develop, jealous colleagues, interfering mothers, and the danger of their secrets being exposed threaten the arrangement they have built. Dramzio is one place where this series can be followed.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/flash-marriage-to-my-billionaire-hobo-hubby/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/flash-marriage-to-my-billionaire-hobo-hubby/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Contract Marriage","Secret Identity","Flash Marriage","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dgxrq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_flash-marriage-to-my-billionaire-hobo-hubby_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dgxrq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_flash-marriage-to-my-billionaire-hobo-hubby_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dgxrq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_flash-marriage-to-my-billionaire-hobo-hubby_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{